<t>A profile of RFC 4231 for nish/crypto/hmac (std/crypto/hmac.ts): HMAC
(<xref target="HMAC"/>) instantiated with SHA-256, SHA-384 and SHA-512. Every requirement
quotes RFC 4231, the main source, and every RFC 4231 test vector for those
three hash functions is held here.</t>
    </abstract>
  </front>
